/// CHARACTER XP CURVE — the exact 1.29 XP→level table, the immutable progression law (SPEC §3: "the immutable
/// 200-level retro curve"). Copied VERBATIM from `packages/move/sources/character/character_xp.move` (the
/// abandoned root lineage's canonical on-chain SSOT), which was itself verified exact against
/// the reference corpus's `Experience.java` and triangulated against
/// `packages/sdk/src/experience.js` (formulas annex §5). The table + binary search are unchanged; this pass
/// only adds `xp_for_level` (progression's cap-discard needs the threshold at the max reachable level) and a
/// `max_level` getter. NOT a GameConfig dial — like the SPEC promises, the curve is hardcoded.
module aresrpg_foundation::character_xp;

